  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-15T03:40:17.960Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There should be an optional leaving/spawning animation for users. Not avatar wise, I mean spawn/ leaving with animation varieties such as smoke bomb, teleport beam, lightning strike, asteroid/meteor strike, and etc. kinda like rec room. When a user spawns/leaves, there’s always the poof. I think just appearing and disappearing out of nowhere in thin air is just dumb. I think that entering an exiting worlds should have a little more style than just appearing as nothing. I mean, that’s one way to know a user joined, right?",
